      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REDEMPTION MISS (2) moderate effort at this track two runs ago then settled back and failed to finish off well enough at her latest appearance over 1720m at Young, beaten 23 metres into seventh. Will enjoy a nice run from this favourable starting position. This should be an easier assignment so she is in the right race to return to form. LETS WINK (5) is at the track for the first time. By Soho Lanikai and hails from the Josh Turnbull stable. Was not far away in a recent trial. Will be right there at the business end. CHARLOTTES DIAMOND (1) is better than her last-start eighth over 1700m at Cowra. TAKE ME TOO (10) is worth some thought after his last-start fourth over 1710m at Goulburn on September 28.",
